<title>USA: Dixon Ticonderoga Co Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Dixon Ticonderoga Co Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HEATHROW, Fla. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.17     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net profit		    572     loss	   564</p>
<p> Revs			 31,958		   26,355</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    3,293		    3,193</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.27   profit	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net profit		    886   profit	 1,063</p>
<p> Revs			106,696		   95,565</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    3,234		    3,181</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1996 net includes $0.09/shr for early redemption of debt.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 net includes $0.30/shr provision for litigation settlements and $0.14/shr loss from discontinued opers.</p>
<p>Year 1996 net includes $0.45/shr provision for litigation settlements.</p>
<p>Year 1995 net includes $0.30/shr provision for litigation settlements and $0.19/shr loss from discontinued opers.</p>
<p>Periods ended Sept 30.</p>
